WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.272
Today is the final check. It takes about four minutes.

2
00:00:03.722 --> 00:00:07.890
Your child uses the page with the pictures. You have the grown-up page.

3
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:14.884
It has the same three parts as day one. Starts the same. Rhymes. Then push together, and pull apart.

4
00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:18.434
Say the name of every picture first. Then do not help.

5
00:00:19.134 --> 00:00:24.876
Part C matters most. Its six pictures are used nowhere else in the book, so memory cannot help.

6
00:00:25.326 --> 00:00:29.654
Say the sounds the same way as on day one. Slowly, short and clean.

7
00:00:35.058 --> 00:00:36.079
The word is web.

8
00:00:36.979 --> 00:00:41.408
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

9
00:00:41.858 --> 00:00:46.056
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

10
00:00:46.506 --> 00:00:53.034
If rhymes are still hard but the rest is there, do not wait for them. Go on, and keep reading the rhyme story.

11
00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:58.153
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
